    {
      "id": "claim_4bbb76156574433abd23b479802b8762",
      "statement": "Reconnect restarts the OAuth flow against the SAME account DO (prepareReconnect sets a fresh initiation nonce plus a reconnecting flag), so the existing account Fetcher and every gatekeeper binding created through it keep working with the new grant.",
