    {
      "id": "claim_592a39c1becd4f3a9f8cb021da1928ab",
      "statement": "GatekeeperConnectOptions.scopes selects the tier: 'auth' requests only the minimal scopes to verify the user's email and yields a transient grant (GitHub read:user user:email; Google openid/userinfo.email/userinfo.profile), while the default 'full' persists a usable connected account with the vendor's capability scopes (GitHub repo read:user user:email; Google the scopes of the selected resources).",
