    {
      "id": "claim_14526791f4854bea841f66170c5e178d",
      "statement": "Resource granularity is expressed as SupportedResource urlPatterns resolved by getGatekeeperClassFor: GitHub offers repository, issue, and pull-request patterns (issues/PRs inherit the repo ACL), while Google offers Gmail, Doc, Spreadsheet, Calendar, BigQuery, and three Drive shapes with per-resource OAuth scopes in RESOURCE_SCOPES plus IDENTITY_SCOPES requested on every connection.",
